              <th style="padding: 0.6rem 0.75rem;">Memory Concurrency &amp; MSHRs</th>
              <th style="padding: 0.6rem 0.75rem;">Key Microarchitectural Technique</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
