            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="padding: 0.6rem 0.75rem;"><strong>Archetype 3</strong><br /><small class="text-muted">Modular Coherent Multi-Core</small></td>
              <td style="padding: 0.6rem 0.75rem;"><strong>Tile composability &amp; cluster scalability.</strong> Partition pipeline into FIFO-decoupled domains with directory MESI cache coherence.</td>
